OL,3,GNEWSAAllow carnival clubs to use
OL,4,Acheaper red diesel - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Somerset MP is lobbying the
OL,7,Fgovernment to ask it to allow carnival
OL,8,Fclubs to use red diesel as a
OL,9,Fcost-saving measure.
OL,11,FConservative MP for Bridgwater Sir
OL,12,FAshley Fox believes allowing the clubs
OL,13,Fto use the fuel, which is taxed a lower
OL,14,Frate, could prevent some clubs from
OL,15,Ffolding due to costs.
OL,17,FGuy Fawkes Carnival said it welcomed
OL,18,Fthe support, and added that it wanted
OL,19,Fto find ways to make their carnivals
OL,20,Fcleaner and more sustainable in the
OL,21,Ffuture.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
