OL,3,GNEWSAAllow carnival clubs to use
OL,4,Acheaper red diesel - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, a Treasury spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid the government is already helping
OL,8,Fwith fuel costs by extending the 5p
OL,9,Ffuel duty cut, but said it keeps all
OL,10,Ftaxes under review.
